    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<div><strong>專書</strong></div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Brueckner, J. K. (2011).<em> Lectures on Urban Economics</em>. The MIT Press.&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Evans, A. W. (2004). <em>Economics, Real Estate and the Supply of Land</em>. Wiley.</li>\n\t<li>Leece, David (2004). <em>Economics of the Mortgage Market:&nbsp;Perspectives on Household Decision Making</em>. Wiley.</li>\n\t<li>Tietenberg, T. and Lewis, L. (2018). <em>Environmental and Natural Resource Economics</em>. Routledge.</li>\n\t<li>Hussen, A. M. (2001). <em>Principle of Environmental Economics: Economics, Ecology, and Public Policy</em> (陳凱俐譯). 揚智。</li>\n\t<li>Sieg, H. (2020). <em>Urban Economics and Fiscal Policy</em>. Princeton University Press.</li>\n\t<li>Friedman, L. S. (2002)&nbsp;<em>The Microeconomics of Public Policy Analysis</em>.&nbsp;Princeton University Press.&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>McDonald, J. F. and&nbsp;McMillen, D. P.&nbsp;<em>Urban Economics and&nbsp;Real Estate.</em> Wiley.</li>\n\t<li>林森田、丁秀吟 (2017)。「土地經濟學」 (第二版)。臺北：巨流。</li>\n\t<li>韓乾 (2013)。「土地資源經濟學」。臺北：五南。</li>\n\t<li>羅清俊 (2020)。「公共政策：現象觀察與實務操作」。臺北：揚智。</li>\n\t<li>邊泰明 (2018)。「土地使用規劃與財產權：理論與實務」。臺北：詹氏。</li>\n\t<li>李春長 (2012)。「不動產經濟學」。臺北：智勝。</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div><strong>期刊</strong></div>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Badarinza, C., and&nbsp;Ramadorai, T. (2025). International dimensions of housing markets.&nbsp;<em>Journal of Economic Perspectives</em>,&nbsp;<em>39</em>(3), 87-106.</li>\n\t<li>Brueckner, J. K. (2023). <em>JUE Insight: Zoning and property taxation revisited &mdash; Was Hamilton right?</em> Journal of Urban Economics.</li>\n\t<li>Howard, G., and&nbsp;Liebersohn, J. (2025). How regional inequality and migration drive housing prices and rents.&nbsp;<em>Journal of Economic Perspectives</em>,&nbsp;<em>39</em>(3), 3-26.</li>\n\t<li>Mense, A., Michelsen, C., &amp; Kholodilin, K. A. (2023). Rent control, market segmentation, and misallocation: Causal evidence from a large-scale policy intervention.&nbsp;<em>Journal of Urban Economics</em>,&nbsp;<em>134</em>, 103513.</li>\n\t<li>陳明郎(1995), 「房地產需求與經濟成長」，《<em>開放總體經濟論文</em>集》，許嘉棟、吳中書主編，頁181-201，台北，中央研究院經濟研究所。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": null
